und: transparent;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .health {\n      color: #007849;\n      font-size: 35px;\n      line-height: 0.9;\n    }\n\n    .health-details {\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      padding-top: 5px;\n      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n    }\n\n    .health-details strong {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .who {\n      color: #111;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n    }\n\n    .who span {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 5px;\n      font-size: 25px;\n    }\n\n    .slogan {\n      color: var(--brown);\n      font-size: 42px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .document-data {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 1839px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 0;\n      }\n\n      .poster {\n        width: 1800px;\n        margin: 0;\n        transform: scale(calc(100vw / 1800));\n        transform-origin: top left;\n      }\n\n      body {\n        height: calc(1200px * (100vw / 1800));\n        overflow-x: hidden;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"poster\">\n    <div class=\"poster-inner\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">\n        <span>Dintlha tše Bohlokwa tše hlano</span>\n        <span>go Dijo tše di Bolokegilego</span>\n      </h1>\n\n      <section class=\"rows\">\n        <article class=\"key-row row-one\">\n          <div class=\"visual\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: hands being washed beneath a tap]</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"band\">Dula o hlwekile</div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>Hlapa diatla tša gago pele o swara dijo le gona kgafetša kgafetša ka nako ya go lokiša dijo</li>\n              <li>Hlapa diatla tša gago ka morago ga ge o boa ntlwaneng</li>\n              <li>Hlapa o be o hlwekiše mabato le ditlabelo tšeo di somišwago ge go lokišwa dijo</li>\n              <li>Šireletša mafelo a ka moraleng le dijo go dikhunkhwane, diphoofolo tše dingwe</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"reason\">\n            <div class=\"reason-title\">Ka baka la eng?</div>\n            <p>Le ge bontši bja dikokwana di sa hlole malwetši, dikokwana tšeo di lego kotsi di hwetšwa ka bontši mo mobung, meetseng, diphoofolong le bathong. Dikokwana tše di rwala ke diatla, masela a go hlatswa le go phumola le dibjana, kudukudu diporoto tše go segelwago dijo go tšona ebile kgomano e nnyane e ka di fetišetša go dijo tša hlola malwetši a go phatlalatšwa ka dijo.</p>\n          </aside>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"key-row row-two\">\n          <div class=\"visual\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: raw and cooked foods separated by a red cross]</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"band\">Aroganya dijo tšeo di sego tša apewa le tšeo di apeilwego</div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>Aroganya nama ya kgomo, kgogo le hlapi tšeo di sego tša apewa ya kgomo, kgogo le hlapi le dijo tše dingwe</li>\n              <li>Hlatswa dibjana tša go swara le mafaka le boroto tše dingwe tša go segela dijo ka mehla pele o di šomiša</li>\n              <li>Boloka dijo ka gare ga dibjana tša go thibela kgomano magareng ga dijo tšeo di sego tša apewa le tšeo di apeilwego</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"reason\">\n            <div class=\"reason-title\">Ka baka la eng?</div>\n            <p>Dijo tšeo di sego tša apewa, kudukudu nama ya kgomo, kgogo le hlapi, le diela tša go tšwa go tšona, di ka ba le dikokwana tše kotsi tšeo di ka fetišetšwago dijong tše dingwe nakong ya ge di apewa le go bolokwa.</p>\n          </aside>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"key-row row-three\">\n          <div class=\"visual\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: steaming cooking pot marked 70°C]</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"band\">Budiša dijo</div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>Apea dijo tša go swana le nama ya kgomo, kgogo, mae le hlapi gore di butswe</li>\n              <li>Dira gore dijo tše bjalo ka disopo le setšhuu di bidišwe go dira bonnete bja gore di fihlele go 70°C</li>\n              <li>Go nama ya kgomo le ya kgogo, dira bonnete bja gore diela tša go tšwa go nama yeo e apewago ga di bonale madi, e seke ya ba tše di pinki. Šomiša themometara mo go kgonegago</li>\n              <li>Ruthufatša ka botlalo dijo tšeo di apeilwego</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"reason\">\n            <div class=\"reason-title\">Ka baka la eng?</div>\n            <p>Go apea ga maleba go bolaya bontši bja dikokwana tše kotsi. Dinyakišišo di bontšhitše gore go apea dijo ka thempheretšha ya 70°C go thuša go dira bonnete bja gore di bolokegile gore di ka lewa. Dijo tšeo di nyakago šedi ye kgolo ya go apewa di akaretša nama ye e sitšwego, nama tša go bešwa, nama yeo e nago le malokolo a magolo le nama ya kgogo ka botlalo.</p>\n          </aside>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"key-row row-four\">\n          <div class=\"visual\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: thermometer with Danger Zone between 5°C and 60°C]</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"band\">Boloka dijo mo dithempheretšhareng tše di bolokegilego</div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>O seke wa tlogela dijo tšeo di apeilwego mo thempheretšhareng ya go lekana le ya ka phapošing sebaka sa go feta diiri tše pedi</li>\n              <li>Dijo ka moka tšeo di apeilwego le tšeo di senyegago ga bonolo di swanetše go tsidifatšwa ka bjako (go fihla ka fase ga 5°C)</li>\n              <li>Boloka dijo tšeo di apeilwego di fiša (go feta 60°C) pele o ka di sola</li>\n              <li>O seke wa boloka dijo nako e telele le ge e ka ba ka gare ga setšidifatši</li>\n              <li>O seke wa tološa dijo tša go kgahla mo thempheretšhareng ya go lekana le ya ka phapošing</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"reason\">\n            <div class=\"reason-title\">Ka baka la eng?</div>\n            <p>Dikokwana di ka ata ka pele kudu ge dijo di bolokilwe ka thempheretšhareng ya go lekana le ya ka phapošing. Ka go boloka dijo dithempheretšhareng tša ka fase ga 5°C goba ka godimo ga 60°C, go ata ga dikokwana go a emišwa. Dikokwana tše dingwe tše kotsi di sa kgona go gola ka fase ga 5°C.</p>\n          </aside>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"key-row row-five\">\n          <div class=\"visual\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: clean water, vegetables and fruit]</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"band\">Šomiša meetse ao a bolokegilego le dijo tšeo di sego tša apewa</div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>Šomiša meetse ao a bolokegilego goba o a hlwekiše go a dira gore a bolokege</li>\n              <li>Kgetha dijo tše hlwekilego le tšeo di loketšego go lewa</li>\n              <li>Kgetha dijo tšeo di hlwekišitšwego, bjalo ka maswi ao a pastearaisitšwego</li>\n              <li>Hlatswa dienywa le merogo, kudukudu ge di se tša apewa</li>\n              <li>O seke wa šomiša dijo tšeo di fetilego ke letšatšikgwedi la go felelwa ke bophelo.</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <aside class=\"reason\">\n            <div class=\"reason-title\">Ka baka la eng?</div>\n            <p>Dijo tšeo di sego tša apewa, go akaretša meetse le aese, di ka šilafatšwa ka dikokwana tše kotsi le dikhemikhale. Dikhemikhale tša go ba le mpholo di ka hlolega ka gare ga dijo tše di senyegilego le tša go bola. Hlokomelo go kgetho ya dijo tšeo di sego tša apewa e magato a bohlokwa go fokotša kotsi.</p>\n          </aside>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n\n      <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-mark health\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[South African Department of Health emblem]</div>\n          health\n          <div class=\"health-details\">\n            Department:<br>\n            Health\n            <strong>REPUBLIC OF SOUTH AFRICA</strong>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footer-mark who\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[World Health Organization emblem]</div>\n          Food Safety\n          <span>World Health Organization</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"slogan\">Tšebo + Maikarabelo = Thibelo</div>\n\n        <div class=\"document-data\">\n          WHO/SDE/PHE/FOS/01.1<br>\n          Distribution: General<br>\n          Original: English\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
